    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Melo's Nightmare</h2><br><strong>Overview:</strong><br><br>\u3000Melo's Nightmare is a first-person perspective 3D escape horror game.<br>\u3000Players find themselves trapped in corridors and must investigate puzzles to attempt escape.<br>\u3000Fulfilling the conditions to escape hidden passageways will unlock the next door.<br>\u3000Activating or finding the correct puzzle triggers changes in the environment.<br><br><strong>Features:</strong><br><br>    A casual horror game akin to walking through a deserted amusement park haunted house.<br>    Lacks typical scary elements found in horror games, making it suitable for beginners in the genre.<br>    As I was unable to play &quot;P.T.&quot;, this game serves as a light homage to it.<br>    If you are familiar with &quot;P.T.&quot;, rest assured there are no frightening scenes here.<br><br>\u3000I think the shortest play time is about 20 minutes.<br><br><strong>Special Functionality:</strong><br><br>    Incorporates Twitch chat integration, providing enjoyment especially for streamers.<br>\u3000When you write the title of a movie related to fire or water, or a scary movie title, in the chat, an event will occur.",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Melo's Nightmare</h2><br><strong>Overview:</strong><br><br>\u3000Melo's Nightmare is a first-person perspective 3D escape horror game.<br>\u3000Players find themselves trapped in corridors and must investigate puzzles to attempt escape.<br>\u3000Fulfilling the conditions to escape hidden passageways will unlock the next door.<br>\u3000Activating or finding the correct puzzle triggers changes in the environment.<br><br><strong>Features:</strong><br><br>    A casual horror game akin to walking through a deserted amusement park haunted house.<br>    Lacks typical scary elements found in horror games, making it suitable for beginners in the genre.<br>    As I was unable to play &quot;P.T.&quot;, this game serves as a light homage to it.<br>    If you are familiar with &quot;P.T.&quot;, rest assured there are no frightening scenes here.<br><br>\u3000I think the shortest play time is about 20 minutes.<br><br><strong>Special Functionality:</strong><br><br>    Incorporates Twitch chat integration, providing enjoyment especially for streamers.<br>\u3000When you write the title of a movie related to fire or water, or a scary movie title, in the chat, an event will occur.",
    "short_description": "Melo's Nightmare is a first-person perspective 3D escape horror game. Players find themselves trapped in corridors and must investigate puzzles to attempt escape. A casual horror game akin to walking through a deserted amusement park haunted house. Will players be able to get out safely?",
